2
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,500
べっくーだ、生存確認！
Beccuda, checking for signs of life!

3
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:29,800
始まったよ〜！始まったよ〜！
It's started! It's started!

4
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:36,500
イェーイ！始まった〜！
Yay! It's started!

5
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:41,800
本日何をするのかというと、ホロライブ夏祭りです！ということで...
What we're doing today is the Hololive Summer Festival! And so...

6
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:44,300
イェーイ！
Yay!

7
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:48,000
それではまず、お見せ屋さんの紹介をしていきたいと思います！
So first, let's introduce the festival booths!

8
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,400
見せ屋さん？
Booths?

9
00:03:49,500 --> 00:03:53,600
まずは、べっくーだ、生存確認！
First up, Beccuda's Survival Check!

10
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:56,800
べっくーだ来た！べっくーだ！
Beccuda is here! Beccuda!

11
00:03:56,800 --> 00:04:00,500
これはハコスちゃんの流しそうめん屋さんです！
This is Hakos-chan's flowing somen booth!

12
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:04,500
いらっしゃいらっしゃい！いらっしゃいらっしゃい！
Step right up, step right up! Welcome, welcome!

13
00:04:04,500 --> 00:04:08,100
流しそうめん準備してお待ちしておりましたー！
Flowing somen is ready and waiting for you!

14
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:12,300
ナイス！今日はね、ハコスがね、大量のそうめんを一人で茹でてきてくれたんだよね！
Nice! Today, Hakos boiled a huge batch of somen all by herself!

15
00:04:12,300 --> 00:04:15,500
すごーい！
Amazing!

16
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:20,800
そうめん食べたい方はこちら！そして、ヨーヨー屋さんもあります！ヨーヨー屋さんですか？
Head over here if you want somen! And we also have a yo-yo booth! Yo-yo booth, are you there?

17
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:24,400
ヨーヨー屋さん 白上フブキでーす！ヨーヨーありまーす！
Shirakami Fubuki at the yo-yo booth! We've got yo-yos!

18
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:28,800
ということで、ヨーヨーしたい方はフブちゃんに声かけてください！そして、
So if you want to play yo-yo, please let Fubu-chan know! And,

19
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:33,800
今スバルのわたあめ屋さんと載ってるんですけど、今日わたあめ屋さんをしてくれるのはこの人！
it says Subaru's Cotton Candy Booth, but the person running it today is...

20
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:39,800
はーい！うちうち、うちだよ！大神ミオだよ！初めてわたあめ作るけど大丈夫かな？よろしくお願いしまーす！
Hi! It's me, me, it's me! Ookami Mio! It's my first time making cotton candy, but I hope it turns out okay! Nice to be here!

21
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:42,500
イェーイ！
Yay!

22
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:43,700
やったー！
Woohoo!

23
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:50,000
そして他にも食べ物がたくさん、たこ焼きとか焼きそばとかリンゴ飴とかあるんで好きに食べてくださーい！
And there's plenty of other food like takoyaki, yakisoba, and candy apples, so feel free to eat whatever you want!

24
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,200
わーい！
Yay!

25
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:55,200
そして今テーブルにいるメンバーまず紹介します！まずは、カリ！
And now let's introduce the members at the table! First up, Calli!

26
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:59,200
あ、皆さん！森カリオペです。よろしくお願いします！やった、夏大好き！
Ah, hello everyone! It's Mori Calliope. Great to be here! Yay, I love summer!

27
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:00,000
イェーイ！
Yay!

28
00:05:00,008 --> 00:05:01,808
イェーイ！
Yay!

29
00:05:01,808 --> 00:05:04,208
まぁまぁまぁ、続いてNerissa！
Alright, alright, alright, next up: Nerissa!

30
00:05:04,208 --> 00:05:09,508
Hi, darlings! Hololive English -Advent-... the one and only Nerissa Ravencroftだよー！
Hi darlings! It's Hololive English -Advent-'s... one and only Nerissa Ravencroft!

31
00:05:09,508 --> 00:05:12,408
イェーイ！
Yay!

32
00:05:12,408 --> 00:05:15,008
フワモコ！
FUWAMOCO!

33
00:05:15,008 --> 00:05:16,808
誰から行く？
Who's going first?

34
00:05:16,808 --> 00:05:17,508
What's up!

35
00:05:17,508 --> 00:05:19,508
キブキー！
Kivukie!

36
00:05:19,508 --> 00:05:23,808
プロローグ！イェーイ！
Prologue! Yay!

37
00:05:23,808 --> 00:05:27,508
はい、ということで、えーこんな感じでね、あとね、あの...
Okay, so as you can see, and also...

38
00:05:27,508 --> 00:05:32,008
全体見る担当の大空スバルです！よろしくお願いしまーす！
I'm Oozora Subaru, in charge of overseeing everything! Great to be here!

39
00:05:32,008 --> 00:05:34,008
イェーイ！
Yay!

40
00:05:34,008 --> 00:05:37,008
はい！それでは好きに楽しんでください！どうぞ！
Alright! Then please feel free to enjoy yourselves! Go ahead!

41
00:05:37,008 --> 00:05:40,008
いこういこう！
Let's go, let's go!

42
00:05:40,008 --> 00:05:43,008
一巡でやってこう！
Let's do one round each!

43
00:05:43,008 --> 00:05:44,808
OK, OK! わたあめ！
OK, OK! Cotton candy!

44
00:05:44,808 --> 00:05:47,008
えっと、何色？
Um, what color?

45
00:05:47,008 --> 00:05:49,008
緑！
Green!

46
00:05:49,008 --> 00:05:51,508
え、自分たちで作るの？
Wait, we make it ourselves?

47
00:05:51,508 --> 00:05:53,308
自分達でやってみたいよね？
You want to try making it yourself, right?

48
00:05:53,308 --> 00:05:57,808
わちゃわちゃするんですけど、夏のわちゃわちゃを楽しんでくださーい！
It's going to be chaotic, but please enjoy the summer chaos!

49
00:05:57,808 --> 00:06:00,008
私やったことないから...
I've never done this before...

50
00:06:00,008 --> 00:06:02,008
初めてなの？
Is it your first time?

51
00:06:02,008 --> 00:06:05,008
さあ、とりあえず...お砂糖入れてから回す...
Now then, for now... put the sugar in before turning it on...

52
00:06:05,008 --> 00:06:07,508
ピザみたいのいる！
There's one that looks like a pizza!

53
00:06:07,508 --> 00:06:10,508
確かになんか光るやつなんだ！
It really is one of those glowing ones!

54
00:06:10,508 --> 00:06:12,808
惜しい！
So close!

55
00:06:14,508 --> 00:06:18,008
あ、見えない糸が出てきた！
Ah, invisible threads started coming out!

56
00:06:18,008 --> 00:06:23,008
キャーー！
Kyahhh!

57
00:06:23,008 --> 00:06:25,508
そうめん流したーい！
We want to slide the somen!

58
00:06:25,508 --> 00:06:27,508
二人が汁こぼしてて草
Lol, both of them are spilling soup.

59
00:06:27,508 --> 00:06:29,008
I'm so sorry!

60
00:06:29,008 --> 00:06:31,508
大丈夫、大丈夫！
It's okay, it's okay!

61
00:06:31,508 --> 00:06:34,008
大丈夫だよ、こっちは！
Don't worry about us over here!

62
00:06:34,008 --> 00:06:36,508
水色のやつにするの？
Are you going for the light blue one?

63
00:06:36,508 --> 00:06:38,208
どうにでもなる！
It'll all work out!

64
00:06:38,208 --> 00:06:40,208
水色ー！
Light blue!

65
00:06:40,208 --> 00:06:43,808
こっからは、ここから流すから！
From here—I'll slide it from here!

66
00:06:44,208 --> 00:06:47,808
ありがとう、ナイスキャッチ！
Thank you, nice catch!

67
00:06:48,008 --> 00:06:50,008
これだ！
This one!

68
00:06:50,008 --> 00:06:53,008
これないと、あと1個もらいだよ！
If you don't get this, you only get one!

69
00:06:53,008 --> 00:06:54,808
どうしよう！
What should I do?

70
00:06:54,808 --> 00:06:57,008
フブキ先輩、優しくしてくださいよ！
Fubuki-senpai, please go easy on them!

71
00:06:57,008 --> 00:06:59,008
1個あげよう、これ！
Let's give them one, here!

72
00:06:59,008 --> 00:07:01,008
いい、大丈夫！
No, it's fine!

73
00:07:01,008 --> 00:07:03,508
好きなの1個、好きなの！
Pick one you like, whatever you like!

74
00:07:03,508 --> 00:07:05,008
いいよ！
That works!

75
00:07:05,008 --> 00:07:07,008
Advent!

76
00:07:07,008 --> 00:07:10,508
栞ちゃんが絶対水色選ぶから水色！
Shiori would definitely pick light blue, so light blue!

77
00:07:10,508 --> 00:07:12,008
これ？
This one?

78
00:07:12,008 --> 00:07:14,208
もらいまーす！
I'll take it!

79
00:07:14,208 --> 00:07:16,208
釣れたー！
I caught it!

80
00:07:16,208 --> 00:07:18,808
釣れたよー！
I caught it!

81
00:07:18,808 --> 00:07:21,008
そしたらそれもらうじゃん！
Then you get to keep that one!

82
00:07:21,008 --> 00:07:23,008
もらいまーす！
Thank you!

83
00:07:23,008 --> 00:07:25,508
釣れましたー！
I caught it!

84
00:07:25,508 --> 00:07:27,508
何ですか？
What is that?

85
00:07:27,508 --> 00:07:30,808
見えない糸みたいなのが出てくるからね！
You see, invisible thread-like stuff comes out!

86
00:07:30,808 --> 00:07:33,508
見えない糸が？
Invisible thread?

87
00:07:33,508 --> 00:07:36,008
見えない糸があるって！
There's invisible thread, I tell you!

88
00:07:36,008 --> 00:07:37,508
マジで？
Seriously?

89
00:07:37,508 --> 00:07:39,508
可愛いー！
So cute!

90
00:07:39,508 --> 00:07:42,008
イェーイ！
Yay!

91
00:07:45,008 --> 00:07:47,808
さすが！
As expected!

92
00:07:50,008 --> 00:07:53,008
誰もキャッチ出来ねえから！
'Cause nobody can catch it!

93
00:07:53,008 --> 00:07:56,508
キャーー！
Kyahhh!

94
00:07:56,508 --> 00:08:00,008
違うだろ！違うだろ！
That's not right! That's not right!

95
00:08:00,008 --> 00:08:02,008
来い、来い！
Come on, come on!

96
00:08:02,008 --> 00:08:04,008
温かいよ、この辺！
It's warm around here!

97
00:08:04,008 --> 00:08:06,008
わたあめできた？
Is the cotton candy ready?

98
00:08:06,008 --> 00:08:09,508
できてない！
Not yet!

99
00:08:10,008 --> 00:08:14,508
テストでは！テスト、テストでは出来てたんです、テストでは！
In testing! In the test—it worked during testing, in testing!

100
00:08:15,008 --> 00:08:18,508
温かくなるまで時間がかかるから...
It takes time for it to warm up...

101
00:08:18,508 --> 00:08:22,008
ナイス、ナイス！
Nice, nice!

102
00:08:23,008 --> 00:08:26,008
出てこないよ！
Nothing's coming out!

103
00:08:26,008 --> 00:08:28,508
え、でもお砂糖入れてから回せばいいの？
Wait, should I put the sugar in before turning it on?

104
00:08:28,508 --> 00:08:30,008
そう！
Yes!

105
00:08:30,008 --> 00:08:31,508
行きます！
Here goes!

106
00:08:31,508 --> 00:08:33,808
まだ溶けてないんだ！
It hasn't melted yet!

107
00:08:33,808 --> 00:08:36,508
キャーー！
Kyahhh!

108
00:08:36,508 --> 00:08:39,008
次、次！
Next, next!

109
00:08:39,008 --> 00:08:41,508
ありがとうございまーす！
Thank you so much!

110
00:08:43,008 --> 00:08:46,008
ナイスー！
Nice!

111
00:08:46,008 --> 00:08:47,808
マジで？
Seriously?

112
00:08:47,808 --> 00:08:49,808
このオレンジ欲しい！
I want this orange one!

113
00:08:49,808 --> 00:08:52,508
流すよー！
Sending it down!

114
00:08:52,508 --> 00:08:54,508
キャッチして！
Catch it!

115
00:08:54,508 --> 00:08:58,508
うわーー！
Uwaaa!

116
00:08:58,508 --> 00:09:01,008
そうそうそう！
Yes yes yes!

117
00:09:01,008 --> 00:09:03,008
頑張れ、頑張れ！
Go for it, go for it!

118
00:09:03,008 --> 00:09:05,508
来た、来た！
Here it comes, here it comes!

119
00:09:05,508 --> 00:09:08,508
いいよ、いいよ！
Looking good, looking good!

120
00:09:08,508 --> 00:09:10,508
惜しい！
So close!

121
00:09:10,508 --> 00:09:12,508
頑張れ！
Keep going!

122
00:09:12,508 --> 00:09:15,508
取れた、取れた！
Got it, got it!

123
00:09:15,508 --> 00:09:17,808
ナイスー！
Nice!

124
00:09:17,808 --> 00:09:20,008
おかわり行く？
Want seconds?

125
00:09:20,008 --> 00:09:21,808
行きます！
Here I go!

126
00:09:21,808 --> 00:09:24,008
お前邪魔なんだよ！
You're in the way!

127
00:09:24,008 --> 00:09:26,508
来た来た！
Here it comes!

128
00:09:26,508 --> 00:09:31,008
キャーー！やめてー！やめて！
Kyahhh! Stop it! Stop!

129
00:09:31,008 --> 00:09:33,508
待って、待って！
Wait, wait!

130
00:09:33,508 --> 00:09:36,008
頑張れ、頑張れ！
You can do it, you can do it!

131
00:09:36,008 --> 00:09:38,208
指でやらないで！
Don't use your fingers!

132
00:09:38,208 --> 00:09:41,508
なんか下手くそ神降臨した？
Did the god of clumsiness just descend?

133
00:09:41,508 --> 00:09:44,508
わたあめー！
Cotton candy!

134
00:09:44,508 --> 00:09:49,008
わたあめ壊れてるんじゃないですか？やめてー！
Isn't the cotton candy machine broken? Stop it!

135
00:09:49,008 --> 00:09:52,008
続いてNerissa！Nerissa！
Next up, Nerissa! Nerissa!

136
00:09:52,008 --> 00:09:55,008
Nerissaは好きなのどうぞ！
Nerissa, pick whichever you like!

137
00:09:55,008 --> 00:10:00,008
どうぞー！
Go ahead!

138
00:10:00,666 --> 00:10:02,216
３、２、１、GO！
3, 2, 1, GO!

139
00:10:02,216 --> 00:10:03,916
スタート！
Start!

140
00:10:03,916 --> 00:10:06,316
待って、回さないで！
Wait, don't spin it!

141
00:10:06,316 --> 00:10:08,516
リオナ！リオナ活動して！
Riona! Riona, get moving!

142
00:10:08,516 --> 00:10:10,516
回ってるよ！
It's spinning!

143
00:10:10,516 --> 00:10:13,216
捕まえて！捕まえて！
Catch it! Catch it!

144
00:10:13,216 --> 00:10:15,516
惜しい！
So close!

145
00:10:15,516 --> 00:10:18,016
いらっしゃい！
Welcome!

146
00:10:18,016 --> 00:10:20,516
あー！破れた！
Ah! It broke!

147
00:10:20,516 --> 00:10:23,016
ダメだ！
No way!

148
00:10:23,016 --> 00:10:25,516
ちょっと待って、これ難しい！
Wait a second, this is hard!

149
00:10:25,516 --> 00:10:27,816
おおー！
Ooh!

150
00:10:27,816 --> 00:10:30,016
取れてる、取れてる！
You're getting them!

151
00:10:30,016 --> 00:10:33,516
何これー！？
What is this?!

152
00:10:33,516 --> 00:10:35,816
あ、いいんじゃない？
Ah, isn't that nice?

153
00:10:35,816 --> 00:10:39,016
食べれそう、食べれそう！
Looks like you can eat it!

154
00:10:39,016 --> 00:10:40,816
頑張れ！
You can do it!

155
00:10:40,816 --> 00:10:43,016
You did it! You can do this!

156
00:10:43,016 --> 00:10:46,016
取れた！取れた！
Got it! Got it!

157
00:10:46,016 --> 00:10:49,016
すごい！
Awesome!

158
00:10:49,016 --> 00:10:52,016
ベネディクタ、頑張れ！
Benedicta, go for it!

159
00:10:52,016 --> 00:10:54,816
行け！行ける行ける！
Go! You got this!

160
00:10:54,816 --> 00:10:57,216
あー！
Ahhh!

161
00:10:57,216 --> 00:11:00,016
全部取れた！
Got all of them!

162
00:11:00,016 --> 00:11:03,516
惜しい！フワちゃん！
So close! Fuwa-chan!

163
00:11:03,516 --> 00:11:05,516
あー！
Ahhh!

164
00:11:05,516 --> 00:11:08,516
I'm so sorry...

165
00:11:08,516 --> 00:11:11,516
イエーイ！釣れたー！
Yay! Caught it!

166
00:11:11,516 --> 00:11:14,016
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

167
00:11:14,016 --> 00:11:16,516
ナイス！
Nice!

168
00:11:16,516 --> 00:11:20,516
危ない！汁飛んでるんだよ！
Watch out! The soup is splashing everywhere!

169
00:11:20,516 --> 00:11:23,016
はい、オッケー！
All right, okay!

170
00:11:23,016 --> 00:11:25,516
上手い！
Nice skills!

171
00:11:25,516 --> 00:11:28,016
わー！よかったー！
Yay! Glad to hear!

172
00:11:28,016 --> 00:11:31,016
綿あめこんなに...
Cotton candy like this...

173
00:11:31,016 --> 00:11:33,516
あ、これ味一緒？
Ah, do they taste the same?

174
00:11:33,516 --> 00:11:36,516
そう、味一緒だよ
Yeah, they taste the same.

175
00:11:36,516 --> 00:11:38,216
せーの、Let's go!
Ready, set, Let's go!

176
00:11:38,216 --> 00:11:41,016
そうめんのところに綿あめ出さないで！
Don't put cotton candy into the somen!

177
00:11:41,016 --> 00:11:43,516
何でだよ！
